sequenceDiagram
  actor student as Verified adult owner
  participant api as Django API
  participant db as PostgreSQL
  participant storage as Private quarantine storage
  participant worker as Scan worker
  participant scanner as Approved sandbox scanner
  student->>api: Initiate upload with CSRF and idempotency key
  api->>db: Check owner, scanner health and reserve bounded storage
  alt Gate missing
    api-->>student: Safe unavailable response and manual alternative
  else Allowed initiation
    api-->>student: Expiring bounded quarantine-only capability
    student->>storage: Upload to exact random object key
    storage-->>student: Object version
    student->>api: Complete with object version and checksum
    api->>storage: Verify actual byte size, hash and immutable identity
    api->>db: Bind owned version and enqueue scan once
    api-->>student: 202 QUARANTINED, inaccessible
    worker->>db: Claim fenced scan job
    worker->>scanner: Scan exact version and bounded format content
    scanner->>storage: Read quarantine object only
    alt Scanner outage, malware or invalid format
      scanner-->>worker: Unavailable or rejected
      worker->>db: Keep inaccessible or reject and schedule purge
    else Exact version is clean
      scanner-->>worker: Clean verdict for object hash and version
      worker->>storage: Place clean immutable bytes in private accepted namespace
      worker->>db: Atomic fenced acceptance, storage accounting and audit
    end
    student->>api: Request owned download capability with CSRF
    api->>db: Recheck owner, lifecycle and ACCEPTED version
    api-->>student: Short private read capability or deny
  end
